        "label": "Lunokhod 2 surface operations",
        "description": "Mission ended 1973-05 when soil contamination on a thermal panel caused overheating. Lunokhod 1 (1970) and Lunokhod 2 (1973) remain the only Soviet lunar rovers; Lunokhod 1 predated Apollo’s Lunar Roving Vehicle (1971) by months, while Lunokhod 2 followed it by nearly two years."
